      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1024,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 992,
        "content": "## Auto Dealership AI Quotation Agent\n### How it works\n\n1. Customer submits a form to initiate a vehicle inquiry.\n2. The workflow normalizes input data and loads dealer configurations.\n3. Inventory is checked to verify whether the requested vehicle is available.\n4. If the vehicle is not found, an email notification is sent; otherwise, the deal is prepared and processed by an AI Sales Agent.\n5. The agent evaluates the transaction, updates Google Sheets, and sends a final reply email to the customer.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- - [ ] Configure the Customer Form trigger with the necessary input fields.\n- - [ ] Set up Google Sheets credentials and link the inventory and deal tracking spreadsheets.\n- - [ ] Provide Gemini API credentials for the AI agent language model.\n- - [ ] Configure Redis connection for chat memory storage.\n- - [ ] Set up Gmail credentials for sending automated emails.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can customize the dealership settings in the configuration nodes and adjust the AI prompt and model parameters in the Sales Agent.\n\n@[youtube](0B5IAirPe5o)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
